- **Bindings**: `cells, key, x, y, live, x, y, neighbourCounts, x, y, dx, dy, k, next, k, count, isAlive, xs, ys` → ~19
- **Invocations**: `cells.map, key, new Set, new Map, key, neighbourCounts.set, neighbourCounts.get, ??, +, +, +, live.has, k.split, next.push, Number, Number` → ~16 → 32
- **Conditionals**: `if dx===0 && dy===0`, `count===3 || (isAlive && count===2)` → 2 → 8
